              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">As the elite Subject Tribesmen: mixed weapons (counts as a hand weapon and javelins) and shield. May have throwing spear (+1 pt). Light Infantry. Warband Psychology Rule 1. Levies. (Byzantium p.60)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
